<article class="env-definition" id="09GS">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09GS">Definition <span data-tag="09GS">9.10.3</span>.</a> Let $F$ be a field. An <em>algebraic closure</em> of $F$ is a field $\overline{F}$ containing $F$ such that: </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$\overline{F}$ is algebraic over $F$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$\overline{F}$ is algebraically closed. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article>